# --- Project-owned ignores ---------------------------------------------------
# These live OUTSIDE the kit block on purpose. They were inside it until
# 2026-08-06, when a kit rewrite replaced the block and took them along: `.env`
# stopped being ignored and `git status -uall` went from 1 to 711 untracked
# paths. A managed block belongs to whoever rewrites it — project rules go here.
# See docs/napkin-lessons.md [2026-08-06] WK-20260806-phase-0-council.

# Secrets — never tracked (docs/limits.md, Security Boundary)
.env
.env.*
*.keystore
*.jks
key.properties

# Flutter / Dart build output
build/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/

# Android
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/captures/

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/

# Local workspace archives
mobile/*.zip
